                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "imamate",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e1651d1-a1ee-3048-9f30-beb6353224e5",
                                        "entry_id": "8b11a034-75de-37c3-a6ac-106ce496a971",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The office or jurisdiction of an imam."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b66f355e-503d-4b16-b24d-8a2b4474b533",
                                                "sense_id": "2e1651d1-a1ee-3048-9f30-beb6353224e5",
                                                "text": "The Mahometans do not agree among themselves about this imamate, or dignity of the imam. Some think it of divine right, and attached to a single family, as the pontificate of Aaron. Others hold, that it is, indeed, of divine right, but deny it to be so attached to any single family, as that it may not be transferred to another."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2abed896-13f6-480b-9ea5-80cb3b59114c",
                                                "sense_id": "2e1651d1-a1ee-3048-9f30-beb6353224e5",
                                                "text": "After mentioning these facts, Shahristâni adds that \"whatever befell them was prognosticated by Jaafar as-Sâdik, who said that temporal dominion was not for their family, but that the Imâmate was to be a toy in the hands of the Abbassides.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f21e89b-6c1e-4716-ab47-1849a2850e5b",
                                                "sense_id": "2e1651d1-a1ee-3048-9f30-beb6353224e5",
                                                "text": "The government has accused the Houthis of trying to restore the traditional Zaidi-led imamate that largely ruled Yemen until 1962."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9a6406a7-12c3-4f36-b323-be81a2a3c09b",
                        "source_entry_id": "84c2b65c-b0c1-3e47-9892-4e7020dfb7aa",
                        "target_lang_word": "imamat",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "imamat",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86a66ed4-5609-365b-915d-f091ef2380d7",
                                        "entry_id": "440c8294-5a3b-39ed-8324-459f874d835a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Système de direction spirituelle et politique par les imams chiites."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Chiisme"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d4111cdc-cfa3-44d1-9cba-14e33aa64ec5",
                                                "sense_id": "86a66ed4-5609-365b-915d-f091ef2380d7",
                                                "text": "Dès les débuts de l’histoire de l’Islam, l’autorité avait reposé sur le principe de l’imamat."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e632e956-c2d9-43ba-9c99-0e9983d809b4",
                                                "sense_id": "86a66ed4-5609-365b-915d-f091ef2380d7",
                                                "text": "Nous, les salafistes, nous disons qu’il faut revenir à l’islam authentique, celui du temps du Prophète — paix sur Lui. Et nous voulons qu’il y ait un imamat indépendant."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
